  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1407.13 Construction Phase Submittal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1407.13 Construction Phase Submittal. During the construction phase of the project, the recipient shall submit to the department:\n\n(a) A notice of completion of construction, upon completion of project construction; and\n\n(b) Any building phase submittals required by the final financial assistance agreement to be submitted to the department.\n\nSource. #13164, eff 1-26-21; ss by #13372, eff 4-21-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1400.html"
